This product includes place data for the place check in Details
(web/assets/place/places.json, served at /res/mapstudio/places.json; its
sources, versions and SHA-256 sums are in web/assets/place/sources.json),
made by web/scripts/place-data.mjs from the following, simplified and
re-encoded:

Natural Earth (https://www.naturalearthdata.com): the 1:10m Admin 1 states
and provinces 5.1.1, the 1:10m Admin 2 counties of the United States 5.1.1
and the 1:10m marine areas 5.1.0.
    Public domain. Made with Natural Earth. Free vector and raster map
    data at naturalearthdata.com.

GeoNames (https://www.geonames.org): the cities5000 export of 2026-11-07,
the names and positions of the towns outside the United States.
    Licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International
    License (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/). GeoNames
    provides the data as is, without warranty of any kind, and does not
    endorse this product. The towns were selected (populated places
    outside the United States, Puerto Rico and the US Virgin Islands) and
    their positions rounded to 0.001 degree.

The borders are simplified, when the data is made, by mapshaper (MPL-2.0),
a development tool that is not redistributed.

